<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <%- include('layout/header') %>
    <style>
        /* Reset and Base Styles */
        html, body {
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            overflow: hidden; /* Para walang lumabas na scrollbar */
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        }

        /* 1. The Blurred Background Image */
        .bg-blurred {
            position: fixed; 
            top: -5%; left: -5%; right: -5%; bottom: -5%; 
            background-image: url('https://spims.cspc.edu.ph/assets/img/background.jpg'); 
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            filter: blur(1px);
            z-index: -1;
        }

        /* 2. The Dark Overlay */
        .bg-overlay {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
            background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); /* Dark navy tint */
            z-index: -1;
        }

        /* 3. Perfect Centering Wrapper */
        .login-wrapper {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100vw;
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column; /* Para magpatong ang titles at card */
            align-items: center;    /* Centers vertically/horizontally */
            justify-content: center;   
            z-index: 1;
            padding: 1rem;
        }

        /* --- BAGONG DAGDAG NA HEADER STYLES & ANIMATIONS --- */
        
        /* Keyframes para sa Fade & Slide Up Animation */
        @keyframes fadeSlideUp {
            0% {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(30px);
            }
            100% {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .header-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            max-width: 800px; /* Para hindi masyadong humaba sa malaking screen */
        }

        .main-title {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 2rem;
            text-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            
            /* Apply animation (Mauuna) */
            opacity: 0;
            animation: fadeSlideUp 0.8s ease-out forwards;
        }

        .sub-title {
            color: #f8fafc;
            font-weight: 400;
            font-style: italic; /* Ibang style as requested */
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
            
            /* Apply animation (Pangalawa, may delay na 0.3s) */
            opacity: 0;
            animation: fadeSlideUp 0.8s ease-out 0.3s forwards;
        }

        .portal-text {
            color: #ffff; /* Distinct gold/yellow color para sa Admin Portal */
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            margin-bottom: 0;
            
            /* Apply animation (Pangatlo, may delay na 0.6s) */
            opacity: 0;
            animation: fadeSlideUp 0.8s ease-out 0.6s forwards;
        }

        /* Responsive para sa Titles */
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .main-title {
                font-size: 1.4rem;
            }
            .sub-title {
                font-size: 0.9rem;
                margin-bottom: 1rem;
            }
            .portal-text {
                font-size: 1.1rem;
            }
        }
        /* -------------------------------------- */

        /* 4. Card Styling (Square at mas maliit - walang binago) */
        .card-custom {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
            border-radius: 1.5rem;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            
            /* Dito natin ginawang Square */
            width: 380px; 
            height: 380px; 
            
            /* Para mag-center ang content sa loob ng square */
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 1.5rem 2rem; 
        }

        /* Responsive para sa mobile card */
        @media (max-width: 400px) {
            .card-custom {
                width: 90vw;
                height: 90vw; /* Keep it square on mobile */
                padding: 1.5rem;
            }
        }

        /* Google Button Styling */
        .btn-google {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            color: #475569;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.9rem; 
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .btn-google:hover {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            border-color: #94a3b8;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .btn-google img {
            width: 18px; 
            height: 18px;
        }

        /* Form Inputs Focus Effect */
        .form-control:focus {
            border-color: #4f46e5;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 0.25rem rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.25);
        }

        /* Extra small text helper */
        .text-xsmall {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
        }

        /* Home button (top-left, floating over the blurred background) */
        .btn-home {
            position: fixed;
            top: 1.25rem;
            left: 1.25rem;
            z-index: 10;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            color: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
            border-radius: 50px;
            padding: 0.5rem 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .btn-home:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        /* Terms & Conditions helper text/checkbox */
        .terms-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }
        .terms-row .form-check-input {
            margin-top: 0.2rem;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .terms-row label {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: #475569;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }
        .terms-row a {
            color: #4f46e5;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .terms-row a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

        #termsModal .modal-body {
            max-height: 60vh;
            overflow-y: auto;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #334155;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        #termsModal .modal-body h6 {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1e293b;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }
        #termsModal .modal-body h6:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="bg-blurred"></div>
    <div class="bg-overlay"></div>

    <a href="/" class="btn-home" title="Return to Home Page">
        <i class="fas fa-home me-1"></i> Home
    </a>

    <div class="login-wrapper">

        <div class="header-container">
            <h1 class="main-title">Office Of Center For Quality Assurance (CQA)</h1>
            <p class="sub-title">Digital Client Satisfaction Survey of Camarines Sur Polytechnic Colleges</p>
            <h2 class="portal-text">Login Portal</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="card-custom">

            <div class="text-center mb-3">
                <img src="https://cspc.edu.ph/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Camarines_Sur_Polytechnic_Colleges_Logo.png" alt="CSPC Logo" style="width: 55px; height: auto; background-color: white; border-radius: 50%; padding: 3px;" class="mb-2 shadow-sm">
                <h4 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-0">CQA Portal Login</h4>
                <p class="text-muted text-xsmall mb-0">Sign in to your account</p>
            </div>

            <!-- UNIFIED LOGIN FORM (POST REQUEST) -->
            <form action="/auth-login" method="POST" id="loginForm">
                <div class="mb-2">
                    <div class="input-group input-group-sm">
                        <span class="input-group-text bg-light border-end-0"><i class="fas fa-user text-muted"></i></span>
                        <input type="text" name="username" class="form-control bg-light border-start-0 ps-0" placeholder="Enter your username or email" required title="Username or Email">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-2">
                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-end mb-1">
                        <a href="#" class="text-decoration-none fw-semibold text-xsmall" style="color: #4f46e5;" title="Reset your password">Forgot Password?</a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="input-group input-group-sm">
                        <span class="input-group-text bg-light border-end-0"><i class="fas fa-lock text-muted"></i></span>
                        <input type="password" name="password" class="form-control bg-light border-start-0 ps-0" placeholder="Enter your password" required title="Password">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="terms-row">
                    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="agreeTerms" required title="You must agree to the Terms and Conditions to continue">
                    <label for="agreeTerms">
                        I agree to the <a href="#" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#termsModal">Terms &amp; Conditions / Privacy Policy</a>
                    </label>
                </div>

                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm w-100 fw-bold py-2" style="background-color: #4f46e5; border-color: #4f46e5;" title="Sign in to your account">
                    <i class="fas fa-sign-in-alt me-2"></i> Login
                </button>
            </form>

        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Terms & Conditions / Privacy Policy Modal -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="termsModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="termsModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-lg">
            <div class="modal-content">
                <div class="modal-header">
                    <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold" id="termsModalLabel">Terms &amp; Conditions / Privacy Policy</h5>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close" title="Close"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body">
                    <h6>Privacy Policy</h6>
                    <p>This privacy statement discloses the privacy practices of the Unified Information System (UnIS) and its sub-modules.</p>

                    <h6>Information Collection and Use</h6>
                    <p>UnIS is the sole owner of the information collected on this site. We will not sell, share, or rent this information to others in ways different from what is disclosed in this statement. UnIS collects information from our users at several different points on our Web application.</p>
                    <p>In order to use some features of this web application, users must first complete the profiling form. During registration, users are required to give their personal and contact information (name and e-mail address), family background, and demographics. This information is used for academic purposes only.</p>

                    <h6>Cookies</h6>
                    <p>UnIS may use cookies to remember if users have logged in while on our site. This allows web site users to avoid logging in more than once, thereby saving time. Users have the option of disabling or not accepting cookies by changing the preferences on their browsers. If users opt to disable cookies, they will still be able to use our Web site. However, they will not be able to use some functionality or post to the message boards. No personally identifiable information (e-mail address, name, etc.) is collected with the cookies that we set. Accepting cookies while on the UnIS site will not put the user at risk for marketing to other sites.</p>

                    <h6>Web Statistics</h6>
                    <p>We use IP addresses to analyze trends, administer the site, track user movement, and gather broad demographic information for aggregate use for reporting purposes. IP addresses are not linked to personally identifiable information.</p>

                    <h6>Sharing</h6>
                    <p>We will not share any information to external organization except for government organization, administration and institutional researcher which is requirement for reporting and analytics purposes. This is not linked to any personal information that can identify any individual person. Data are shared to other institutional information system through a secured and authenticated API.</p>

                    <h6>Security</h6>
                    <p>This Web site takes every precaution to protect our users' information, and we have security measures in place to protect the loss, misuse, and alteration of the information under our control.</p>

                    <h6>Updates</h6>
                    <p>We may also send the user site and service announcement updates.</p>

                    <h6>Data Privacy</h6>
                    <p>All provisions of laws, administrative orders, circular, regulations, and other issuances inconsistent with this policy are hereby repealed or modified accordingly.</p>

                    <h6>Notification of Changes</h6>
                    <p>If we decide to change our privacy policy, we will post those changes on our home page so our users are always aware of what information we collect, how we use it, and under what circumstances, if any, we disclose it. If at any point we decide to use personally identifiable information in a manner different from that stated at the time it was collected, we will notify users by e-mail. Users will have a choice as to whether or not we use their information in this different manner. We will use information in accordance with the privacy policy under which the information was collected.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary px-4" data-bs-dismiss="modal" title="Close this dialog">I Understand</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>

</body>
</html>